</head><body class="__variable_geist_0tvmz3h __variable_geist_mono_1diim1n antialiased"><main><header class="site-header"><a href="/" class="brand-link"><span class="brand-lockup" aria-label="Churvox"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>CHURVOX</span></span></a><nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/product">Product</a><a href="/industries">For trades</a><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/dashboard">See Churvox</a></nav><div class="header-actions"><a href="/login" class="login-link">Log in</a><a href="/signup" class="button button-dark button-small">Start free <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></header><section class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow"><span></span>SIMPLE, HONEST PRICING</p><h1>Pick the level that fits <em>today.</em></h1><p>Every plan starts with 14 days free. No card required. Prices are in NZD, and the full amount including GST is shown on every plan.</p></section><section class="pricing-grid"><article class="price-card"><p class="plan-name">Start</p><div class="plan-price"><strong>$39</strong><span>/ month<br/>+ GST</span></div><div class="plan-total"><span>Total including GST</span><strong>$44.85<small>/ month</small></strong></div><p class="plan-note">For one-person businesses getting organised.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="/signup">Start free <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><ul><li>Jobs and clients</li><li>Quotes and invoices</li><li>Calendar and recurring jobs</li><li>CSV imports and exports</li></ul></article><article class="price-card"><p class="plan-name">Crew</p><div class="plan-price"><strong>$89</strong><span>/ month<br/>+ GST</span></div><div class="plan-total"><span>Total including GST</span><strong>$102.35<small>/ month</small></strong></div><p class="plan-note">For small teams working across the day.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="/signup">Start free <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><ul><li>Everything in Start</li><li>Team scheduling</li><li>Worker view and time tracking</li><li>Photos, notes and job proof</li></ul></article><article class="price-card popular"><span class="popular-flag">MOST POPULAR</span><p class="plan-name">Operator</p><div class="plan-price"><strong>$149</strong><span>/ month<br/>+ GST</span></div><div class="plan-total"><span>Total including GST</span><strong>$171.35<small>/ month</small></strong></div><p class="plan-note">For growing operations that need a tighter office.</p><a class="button button-orange" href="/signup">Start free <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><ul><li>Everything in Crew</li><li>Command approval desk</li><li>Background office preparation</li><li>Payroll preparation and reporting</li></ul></article><article class="price-card"><p class="plan-name">Command</p><div class="plan-price"><strong>$299</strong><span>/ month<br/>+ GST</span></div><div class="plan-total"><span>Total including GST</span><strong>$343.85<small>/ month</small></strong></div><p class="plan-note">For larger teams using Churvox across the whole operation.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="/signup">Start free <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><ul><li>Everything in Operator</li><li>50 active team members</li><li>Advanced capacity</li><li>Priority support</li></ul></article></section><section class="growth-pack"><div><p class="eyebrow dark"><span></span>NEED MORE CAPACITY?</p><h2>Command Growth Pack</h2><p>Add another 50 active team members and extra capacity without changing the way your office runs.</p></div><div class="growth-pack-price"><strong>$99 <small>/ month + GST</small></strong><span>Total including GST <b>$113.85 / month</b></span></div></section><section class="pricing-note"><h2>Every plan keeps you in control.</h2><p>Churvox prepares admin for review. It does not send, charge, sync, file, pay, or change important records without your approval.</p></section><footer><span class="brand-lockup" aria-label="Churvox"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>CHURVOX</span></span><p>Job management that works like an office in the background.</p><span>© 2026 Churvox</span></footer></main><script id="_R_">import("/assets/index-BZXWNUtr.js")</script><script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||a.contentWindow.document;if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML="window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a201ce95fee6a1f1',t:'MTc4NDg4NDM4Ng=='};var a=document.createElement('script');a.src='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js';document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body></html><script>self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__=self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__||[];self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__.push("2:I[\"04ba4c2c8beb\",[],\"default\",1]\n3:I[\"8c0f216c4604\",[],\"Children\",1]\n4:I[\"15c18cfaeeff\",[],\"LayoutSegmentProvider\",1]\n5:I[\"8c0f216c4604\",[],\"Slot\",1]\n6:I[\"593f344dc510\",[],\"RedirectBoundary\",1]\n:HL[\"/assets/index-C_g2zg14.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"__route\":\"route:/pricing\",\"__interceptionContext\":null,\"__layoutIds\":[\"layout:/\"],\"__rootLayout\":\"/\",\"page:/pricing\":\"$L1\",\"layout:/\":[[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"css:/assets/index-C_g2zg14.css\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"precedence\":\"vite-rsc/importer-resources\",\"href\":\"/assets/index-C_g2zg14.css\",\"data-rsc-css-href\":\"/assets/index-C_g2zg14.css\"}],\"$undefined\"],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en-NZ\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"className\"